  {
    "id": 22953462,
    "hashId": "wOr4rY",
    "name": "Pixie Chess - Trailer (environments)",
    "description": "<p>Here are some shots I woked on for 'Pixie Chess - Official Trailer' at the amazing studio Wizz (crcr), which is one of the best team of artists I've ever worked with! (not glazing haha)</p>\n\n<p>These shots are the one I made an environment for. Of course, the incredible team at crcr made sure my humble environments looked super nice in the end: Very precise direction from the directors, super cool 2D animated elements, and great compositing, which I was not responsible for. But the teamwork made it super nice.</p>",
    "client": "Wizz (crcr)",
    "tags": [
      "NoAI",
      "pro"
    ],
